    description: Some("Your Starship has no guns: you capture solar cells by flying over them, twice over for the later racks. Two Sentinels patrol the perimeter throwing fireballs whose patterns partly follow your own flight path. Clear a matrix before the Skip-A-Rack timer runs out and you skip the next one, pocketing its points anyway."),
